Grammar

    0 $accept: transformgraph "end file"

    1 transformgraph: kernellist activenode

    2 activenode: ACTIVE id SEMICOL

    3 kernellist: kernel kernellist
    4           | ε

    5 kernel: DTL backingphyssize id inputlistwrapper ASSIGN LCURLY program RCURLY

    6 backingphyssize: LESS intlit GREATER

    7 inputlistwrapper: COLON inputlist
    8                 | ε

    9 inputlist: id COMMA inputlist
   10          | id

   11 program: constdecls forstatement

   12 constdecls: constdecls constdecl
   13           | constdecls metadatastreamdecl
   14           | ε

   15 metadatastreamdecl: METADATASTREAM LESS intlit COMMA intlit GREATER id SEMICOL
   16                   | METADATASTREAM LESS intlit COMMA id GREATER id SEMICOL

   17 constdecl: type id ASSIGN intlit SEMICOL
   18          | NOPT type id ASSIGN intlit SEMICOL
   19          | type id ASSIGN LCURLY intlist RCURLY SEMICOL

   20 intlist: intlit COMMA intlist
   21        | intlit
   22        | ε

   23 forstatement: FOR LPAREN constdecl expr SEMICOL unarystmt RPAREN LCURLY forstatement RCURLY
   24             | FOR LPAREN constdecl expr SEMICOL unarystmt RPAREN LCURLY innernest RCURLY

   25 outstatements: outstatements outstatement
   26              | outstatement

   27 innernest: outstatements
   28          | ifstatement
   29          | switchstatement

   30 ifstatement: IF LPAREN ISEVEN id RPAREN LCURLY outstatements RCURLY ELSE LCURLY outstatements RCURLY
   31            | IF LPAREN id LESS id RPAREN LCURLY outstatements RCURLY ELSE LCURLY outstatements RCURLY
   32            | IF LPAREN id LESSEQUAL id RPAREN LCURLY outstatements RCURLY ELSE LCURLY outstatements RCURLY
   33            | IF LPAREN id GREATER id RPAREN LCURLY outstatements RCURLY ELSE LCURLY outstatements RCURLY
   34            | IF LPAREN id GREATEREQUAL id RPAREN LCURLY outstatements RCURLY ELSE LCURLY outstatements RCURLY
   35            | IF LPAREN ISEDGE id RPAREN LCURLY outstatements RCURLY ELSE LCURLY outstatements RCURLY
   36            | IF LPAREN ISEDGE id OR ISEDGE id RPAREN LCURLY outstatements RCURLY ELSE LCURLY outstatements RCURLY
   37            | IF LPAREN ISEDGE id AND ISEDGE id RPAREN LCURLY outstatements RCURLY ELSE LCURLY outstatements RCURLY
   38            | IF LPAREN PAD id id id id RPAREN LCURLY outstatements RCURLY ELSE LCURLY outstatements RCURLY

   39 switchstatement: SWITCH LPAREN id RPAREN LCURLY casestatements RCURLY

   40 casestatements: casestatement casestatements
   41               | casestatement

   42 casestatement: CASE COLON outstatements

   43 outstatement: OUT ASSIGN expr SEMICOL

   44 type: INT

   45 expr: expr CROSS expr
   46     | expr LESS expr
   47     | expr STAR expr
   48     | expr MINUS expr
   49     | term

   50 unarystmt: loc POSTINC

   51 term: factor
   52     | LPAREN expr RPAREN

   53 factor: intlit
   54       | loc

   55 intlit: INTLITERAL

   56 loc: id
   57    | id LBRACKET id RBRACKET

   58 id: ID


